d other sound instruments</li><li>Vocal exploration and vocal toning</li><li>Breath awareness</li><li>Chakra exploration and energetic attunement</li><li>Guided reflection and intentional inner work</li><li>Personalized sound and vocal practices</li><li>Between-session reflections and exercises</li></ul><p>Each session is shaped around the individual and what is most relevant to their experience. The work is not a rigid curriculum. Sound, voice, reflection, and personal exploration are woven together according to your needs and the direction of the journey.</p></div></section><section class="asec"><div class="wrap narrow reveal"><span class="eyebrow">Between Sessions</span><h2>The experience continues</h2><p>Each person may receive personalized practices and reflections to explore throughout the week. These are meant to feel supportive and personal, a way to bring what you are exploring into everyday life.</p><ul class="alist"><li>Vocal toning and sound exploration</li><li>Personal sound meditation</li><li>Breath awareness</li><li>Guided reflection and journaling prompts</li><li>Exploring beliefs and patterns through self-inquiry</li><li>Practices that encourage expression, creativity, and self-connection</li></ul></div></section><section class="asec"><div class="wrap narrow reveal"><span class="eyebrow">The Three-Month Format</span><h2>How it unfolds</h2><p><strong style="font-weight:400;color:var(--gold-soft)">Duration:</strong> Three months. <strong style="font-weight:400;color:var(--gold-soft)">Sessions:</strong> 12 weekly, one-on-one sessions. <strong style="font-weight:400;color:var(--gold-soft)">Format:</strong> Available in person or online.</p><div class="fmt"><div><h4>Opening Session</h4><div class="tools" style="border:0;padding:0;margin:.2rem 0 .6rem">90 minutes</div><p>An extended first session to connect, learn about your experiences, explore your intentions, and establish a foundation for the journey.</p></div><div><h4>Ongoing Sessions</h4><div class="tools" style="border:0;padding:0;margin:.2rem 0 .6rem">75 minutes each</div><p>Personalized weekly sessions that combine conversation, reflection, sound, vibration, breath awareness, vocal exploration, and other practices as appropriate.</p></div><div><h4>Closing Session</h4><div class="tools" style="border:0;padding:0;margin:.2rem 0 .6rem">90 minutes</div><p>An extended final session to reflect on the journey, recognize meaningful discoveries, and develop a personal practice to continue beyond the three months.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="asec"><div class="wrap narrow reveal"><span class="eyebrow">A Personalized Experience</span><p class="cintro" style="margin-top:1rem">To give each journey the time and personal attention it deserves, I work with a maximum of three clients at a time.</p></div></section><section class="asec"><div class="wrap narrow reveal"><span class="eyebrow">Investment</span><div class="pricebox"><!-- EDIT PRICE: change the text inside the next two lines -->
